.title  Clipping: a wall in front of your eye, and a frame around the glass
.what   A point behind your eye has no image, and the machine will hand you a number anyway. Flight over a flat lattice painted by a Diamond-Square island, on the modules OWL FLY is built from: the near-plane cut of an edge, the screen clip of a line, the divide fault caught and counted - and one byte that flips the engine between the game's classic arithmetic and the lessons' way, with the frame rate on the glass
.tier   LESSON
.main   CLIP.ASM
.build  FASM CLIP.ASM CLIP.COM
.run    CLIP.COM
.uses   IMUL IDIV MUL SHL SHR INT PUSH POP STI CLI LODSB STOSB MOVSW
.reads  INFOGR.PAS
.ignore MAKEINFO.BAT
